    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "If you walked away from this article and implemented these five practices, your React components would immediately become more reusable, maintainable, and professional. These aren't theoretical ideals-they're battle-tested patterns used by the most successful component libraries and React teams in the industry. Here's your concrete action plan."
    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
